<section image-layout="blank" id="oMip1Sy-4R"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="H1m-7CruSC"><h2>Replace the scenario with your property data</h2><labels><label variant="solid">Illustrative example—not actual company or hotel performance</label></labels><grid spacing="medium" vertical-sizing="fill"><grid-item id="CDSQ7aOjI4" vertical-align="center" colspan="34"><table col-widths="[30,70]" header-row="true" borders="rows" striped="false" style="--table-cell-padding: 2pt 10pt;"><tbody><tr><th><p>Line</p></th><th><p>Illustrative formula</p></th></tr><tr><td><p font-size="16pt"><b>Capacity</b></p></td><td><p font-size="16pt">2 sessions × 8 places × 30 days = <b>480 places/month</b></p></td></tr><tr><td><p font-size="16pt"><b>Base-case revenue</b></p></td><td><p font-size="16pt">480 × 50% = 240 participants; 240 × $55 = <b>$13,200</b></p></td></tr><tr><td><p font-size="16pt"><b>Direct costs</b></p></td><td><p font-size="16pt">60 × $125 = $7,500; 240 × $5 = $1,200; fixed support = $1,000</p></td></tr><tr><td><p font-size="16pt"><b>Contribution</b></p></td><td><p font-size="16pt">$13,200 − $7,500 − $1,200 − $1,000 = <b>$3,500/month</b></p></td></tr></tbody></table></grid-item><grid-item id="5MMDRvxW-5" vertical-align="center" colspan="26"><h3>Contribution sensitivity</h3><graph chart-type="column" show-data-labels="true" goal-value="0" goal-label="Direct-cost break-even" text-size="md" config="{&quot;legend&quot;:{&quot;position&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}}" width="330pt" height="170pt"><properties><property key="fill" label="Seat fill" type="label"></property><property key="contribution" label="Contribution (USD)" type="data"></property></properties><data><row><cell>35%</cell><cell>-100</cell></row><row><cell>50%</cell><cell>3500</cell></row><row><cell>65%</cell><cell>7100</cell></row></data></graph><p font-size="16pt"><b>Break-even:</b> approximately 170 participants (36% seat fill).</p></grid-item></grid><aside icon="false"><p font-size="15pt"><b>Scope:</b> contribution excludes internal hotel labor, room opportunity cost, taxes, payment fees and capital expenditure. Illustrative USD assumptions use a 30-day month; do not apply the monthly result directly to the four-week pilot.</p></aside></grid-item></grid></section>